  {
   "q": "Wired or battery doorbell?",
   "a": "Wired doorbells use your existing doorbell wiring for constant power and faster response, and they ring your existing chime. Battery doorbells install anywhere but need recharging every few months."
  },
  {
   "q": "Do I need a subscription?",
   "a": "Many cameras store clips in the cloud only with a monthly plan. Others record to a microSD card or a base station for free. Check what the free tier includes before you buy several."
  }
